From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <muthukumardce@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Feb 2026 19:13:53 +0530
Subject: Session-level fingerprint override: migrate all 283 ForBinding hooks
 from JS callbacks to C++ storage

Replace the entire window.customOverrides JS callback system with direct
C++ storage reads in all ForBinding hooks. Previously, each hooked API
called GetCustomOverrideFunction() which looked up a JS callback from
window.customOverrides (set by preload scripts via process.argv extraction).
Now all hooks read directly from UAOverrideManager's per-Agent-cluster
SessionOverrideStorage, eliminating the JS layer entirely.

== Infrastructure (Stage 1.4-1.5) ==

- Extend UAOverrideManager with 60+ new fields in SessionOverrideStorage:
  hardware (cores, ram, gpu), screen (width, height, dpr, colorDepth),
  network (type, effectiveType, rtt, downlink), language, timezone, geo,
  battery, storage quota, font allowlist, 16 noise seeds, disabled set

- Add Mojo IPC: PageBroadcast::UpdateFingerprintConfig(map<string,string>?)
  Browser process pushes config to renderer at navigation commit via
  RenderFrameHostImpl::CommitNavigation()

- Add ContentBrowserClient::GetFingerprintConfig() virtual method
  for Electron shell to provide per-BrowserContext override config

- WebViewImpl receives and parses config, calls UAOverrideManager::SetOverrides()

- New session_override_helpers.h: GetSessionOverrideStorage(),
  GetSessionOverrideValue<T>(), IsOverrideDisabled(), SeededNoise()

== ForBinding hook conversion (Stage 2.1-2.8) ==

Pattern A/B (simple value return, ~80 APIs):
  screen.width/height/colorDepth, navigator.hardwareConcurrency/deviceMemory,
  navigator.doNotTrack/maxTouchPoints, window.devicePixelRatio,
  networkInformation.type/rtt/downlink, batteryManager.charging/level,
  storageManager.estimate, navigator.language/languages, etc.

Pattern D (seeded noise, ~50 APIs):
  analyserNode.getFloat/ByteFrequencyData, audioBuffer.getChannelData,
  element.getBoundingClientRect/getClientRects/offsetTop/offsetLeft,
  range.getBoundingClientRect, svgGeometryElement.getTotalLength,
  canvas2d.getImageData/measureText, webgl.readPixels, performance.now, etc.

Pattern V/X (V8 built-in wrappers, ~30 APIs):
  Math functions read math_seed from storage, Date/Intl use timezone/locale,
  remove GenericBuiltinWrapper/GenericConstructorWrapper JS callback machinery
  (-1500 lines from v8_builtin_overrides.cc)

Pattern F (async/promise, ~20 APIs):
  geolocation.getCurrentPosition/watchPosition returns stored coords,
  mediaDevices.enumerateDevices, speechSynthesis.getVoices,
  crypto.subtle.* timing, cache/cacheStorage timing noise, etc.

Pattern W/Y (event interception + property existence, ~30 APIs):
  Block sensor events (gyroscope, accelerometer) via disabled set,
  navigator.plugins/mimeTypes, notification constructor,
  serviceWorkerContainer.register, vibrationController, etc.

Font allowlist:
  font_cache.cc reads allowed font list from SessionOverrideStorage
  instead of hardcoded list. If not set, allows all fonts.

== Removed infrastructure ==

- GetCustomOverrideFunction() from custom_override_helpers.h
- GenericBuiltinWrapper, GenericConstructorWrapper, V8 Private container
  lookup, __ro/__rov/__rUA bridge registration (all from v8_builtin_overrides)
- All window.customOverrides references from ForBinding implementations

== Result ==

Zero preload scripts needed for fingerprinting. All 283 ForBinding hooks
read from C++ storage directly. Service Workers automatically inherit
parent page config via Agent-cluster storage. HTTP headers (UA, CH,
Accept-Language) overridden at ContentBrowserClient level.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

